title: Native API Unhooking / Direct Syscalls
id: b19bb08e-63c3-4ed1-87d2-a1a7ac9429a4
status: experimental
description: Detects behaviors associated with EDR unhooking and direct syscalls, such as a process mapping a fresh copy of ntdll from disk or KnownDlls and executing syscall stubs, used to bypass user-mode API hooks.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1106/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: create_remote_thread
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 8
    StartModule|endswith: '\\ntdll.dll'
  filter:
    SourceImage|startswith: 'C:\\Windows\\'
  condition: selection and not filter
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SourceImage
  - TargetImage
falsepositives:
  - Some legitimate runtimes remap ntdll
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1106
